flowchart LR
    subgraph Jobs
        J1[READACCT\nIEFBR14 predel → CBACT01C]
        J2[READCARD\nCBACT02C]
        J3[READXREF\nCBACT03C]
        J4[INTCALC\nCBACT04C PARM=yyyymmddhh]
    end
    ACCT[(ACCTDATA\nVSAM KSDS)] --> J1
    CARD[(CARDDATA\nVSAM KSDS)] --> J2
    XREF[(CARDXREF\nVSAM KSDS + AIX)] --> J3
    TCAT[(TCATBALF\nVSAM KSDS)] --> J4
    XREF -->|alt-key acct-id| J4
    ACCT -->|I-O rewrite| J4
    DISC[(DISCGRP\nVSAM KSDS)] --> J4
    J4 --> SYST[(SYSTRAN +1\nnew GDG member)]
    J1 --> OUT[(OUTFILE)] & ARR[(ARRYFILE)] & VB[(VBRCFILE)]
    note["Jobs are independent — no JCL-level chaining.\nINTCALC is the only writer of TRANSACT\nand the only updater of ACCTDATA."]
    note -.-> J4
